    h = pads(net, 'J', h, n0); close(net, b, 'J', n0); return h
def iteration4(net, h, c):
    """ITERATION 4 (64 nodes): break the regularity. Matthieu: the band is still far from the reference. Measured gap after iteration 3: detail energy 0.017 against 0.041. So: fibre lines that start and stop (a second set at an irregular 57 per unit spacing with its own strong modulation), BRIGHT hairlines beside the dark ones on the wings, shoulder lines on the outer neck (same ray coordinate as the wings), and a second pass of the dark lines with a different phase noise."""
